      "id": 1,
      "text": "Pateros was founded as Ive's Landing in 1886 by Lee Ives, who built an 18‑room hotel and operated a ferry across the Columbia.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7,
        21
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
